{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"晚間氣溫進一步下降　市區最低17度\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/COLD-NIGHT-261109-21.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】天文台表示，晚間氣溫進一步下降，市區最低17度，新界再低一兩度。</p><p>天文台科學主任許漢加：「這個月份開始步入秋季，受到東北季候風影響，所以不時有溫度下降的情況都是正常的。預料東北季候風未來一兩天會繼續影響本港，去到周三，日夜溫差仍然頗大，早上新界仍然清涼。隨著這股季候風，在本周後期緩和，本港氣溫會有所回升。」</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T13:43:49.165233+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":162,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T13:12:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:54:11.361541+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T13:37:26.062524+00:00","content_hash":"a7bb1fb6efa8292cc5b84f2b17f6458ada0794d5c90193b262faeabb1bef9cd6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-09T13:43:49.165233+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}